<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Straits shareholders approve Sebuku.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Straits shareholders approve Sebuku.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Straits Resources Ltd said on Tuesday that shareholders had approved the acquisition of Straits Sebuku Pte Ltd for US$20.6 million.</p>
<p>Straits said the acquisition gave it an 80 percent interest in the Sebuku coal project and a 64 percent interest in the Sungei Durian coal exploration project in Indonesia.</p>
<p>The acquisition price was to be funded by US$10.6 million in cash from company reserves and the issue of 7.91 million Straits Resources shares at a price of A$1.60 per share.</p>
<p>Straits Resources shares closed unchanged at A$1.78.</p>
<p>--Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
